  "id": "qualitative-evaluation",
  "term": "qualitative evaluation",
  "definition": "Qualitative evaluation is an assessment based on the observed pattern or variability of data rather than relying only on a single numerical average. In the source study, it meant judging whether dynamic recordings showed high or low variability to capture meaningful differences that the mean value alone could miss.",
