      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports a study-specific classification of LLT trace variability, but it does not support the broad, general definition of “qualitative evaluation” as an assessment based on observed patterns or variability of data in general.",
        "The definition frames the term as a general methodological concept, whereas the source only shows one retrospective study using high- vs low-variability labels for dynamic recordings; that scope is narrower than the wording implies.",
        "The requested learning-field sense is not directly supported by the packet, which is about ophthalmology and meibomian gland dysfunction rather than learning or educational evaluation."
